 "headline": "Shai Scores 38 On The Bench",
 "notes": [
  "Adam Silver Dez Nuts left Shai Gilgeous-Alexander on the bench for 38 points, 7 assists and 4 threes, then shot him 13-for-30 anyway.",
  "MONSTARS took FG% and AST from Thug Life tonight, thanks to Tyler Herro's 32 points on 10-for-16 and Scottie Barnes' 31 with 4 blocks.",
  "Thug Life got 34 points from Jaden McDaniels and 18 boards from Donovan Clingan, and still handed MONSTARS two categories on the way out.",
  "Zero Fox Given grabbed FT% from Suggs to be you while Myles Turner dropped 27 points and 5 threes. Suggs answered by retaking PTS.",
  "White Mambas are trailing 3-7 with Ryan Rollins hitting 3-of-8 for 6 points, while LeParth James got 3 points from Anfernee Simons and nothing else."
 ],
